## Integration Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────┐
│  TerminalKeyboard   │
│  (onKeyPress/       │
│   onSpecialKey)     │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           │
           v
┌──────────────────────┐
│     sendToShell()    │
└──────────┬───────────┘
           │
           v
┌──────────────────────┐
│ sshService.writeToShell()
│ (SSH channel write)  │
└──────────────────────┘
           │
           v
┌──────────────────────┐
│   Remote tmux/shell  │
└──────────┬───────────┘
           │
           v
┌──────────────────────┐
│ sshService.onShellOutput()
│ (SSH channel read)   │
└──────────┬───────────┘
           │
           v
┌──────────────────────┐
│ terminalRef.write()  │
│ (XtermTerminal)      │
└──────────────────────┘
```

## Key Points

1. **No base64 encoding needed** - sshService already handles string data
2. **Resize sync** - Layout changes trigger cols/rows recalculation
3. **Existing keyboard mappings preserved** - No changes to TerminalKeyboard.tsx
4. **UI layout unchanged** - Header, status bar, keyboard all preserved
